16
00:00:49,972 --> 00:00:51,942
(Amy:)Jean Buridan proposed

17
00:00:51,941 --> 00:00:53,471
(Amy:)a philosophical thesis
stating that

18
00:00:53,476 --> 00:00:55,876
(Amy:)a hungry donkey placed
between two equidistant

19
